    value: "10.5281/zenodo.23992778"
    description: "Version 2026.11.05-revision-r1: analyses added during review, with the files of the previous version retained"
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.23308077"
    description: "Version 2026.10.11-controls-audit: evaluated implementation and analyses of the original submission"
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.23101191"
    description: "Version 2026.10.02-author-review: earlier author-review release of the software"
repository-code: "https://github.com/PeterPonyu/tessera-st"
keywords:
  - spatial transcriptomics
  - graph encoder
  - neighborhood averaging
  - attribution
  - reproducibility
